{"id": "DcjErJwvQjv", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"GOOGLE\" to get these 100+ skills from Google turn Claude Code into a Google expert.\n\nGoogle just dropped over 100 AI skills that make your Claude Code an expert on Google's entire stack.\n\nIt's called Google Agent Skills.\n\nIt's a free open source library that's already crossed 18k stars on GitHub.\n\nSo instead of guessing, your coding agent now follows Google's own official playbooks.\n\nFor handling Google Analytics, Gemini, Ads, Cloud, and Firebase.\n\nAnd with it, you can build your own Google AI ecosystem right inside your terminal.\n\nOne skill pulls your Analytics data.\n\nThe next one finds exactly what's underperforming.\n\nAnd another goes and fixes your ad campaigns based on it.\n\nThink of it like having a full Google specialist team working through your terminal.\n\nEach one an expert in their own part of the stack.\n\nAnd this entire setup takes just one command to install.\n\nNo manual configuration, no digging through separate docs for every single product.\n\n#claudecode #claudeskills #googleskills #googleai #googleagent", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1787843354, "like_count": 2145, "comment_count": 2839, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1685831955817459a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 66.931, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNRQ6Nv4cYWkYRNiQ_H0ATNx7rmpEC43WsFhMLc9AWjzi9Pm4og5nuGEcqjgtQadie2qyMYaRliP1OUWde4KLnhknstfiWJkxyvu3I.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=Adrpsne9Tr4RkAdx9dbfXO2W5Arx-Ve8RZNTCqfEgrSrGksBUAUDtckFqbUXTIpF3qw&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=K2-w7T3hswIQ7kNvwFUVaof&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=KDxBCA_y91j-iOaiq2qRYA&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRKskIyE0x